flowchart LR
  subgraph Scrapers
    S1[Scrapers (scrapers/*)\nPlaywright/requests] -->|items| Runner[Runner / services.scraper_runner]
  end

  Runner -->|insert_items()| DB[SQLite (data/data.db)\nscraped_items]

  DB --> PriceHist[scraped_price_history \n(triggers)]
  DB --> PriceKey[scraped_price_history_key \n(triggers)]
  DB --> Best[scraped_best_offers]

  subgraph Processing
    RunnerJobs[Runner: normalization + summaries] --> Best
    Alerter[worker/alerter.py] -->|reads| Best
  end

  Alerter -->|send_offer()| Notifier[notifier/telegram_bot.py]
  Notifier -->|Telegram Bot API| Telegram[(Telegram Chat)]

  Listener[scripts/telegram_async_bot.py] -->|commands (/best)| DB
  API[FastAPI (main.py)] -->|HTTP| DB

  note right of DB
    product_key links items, histories and best_offers
  end

  style DB fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style Notifier fill:#efe,stroke:#333
  style Alerter fill:#ffe,stroke:#333
